I am in favor of the logic wishing tree.

The logic tree is used to avoid nasty spelling questions which are sometimes
very hard to understand for non-english or non-american speaking nethackers
(of which I am one, will NH3.0PL8 have Native Language Support ? :-).
Above that sometimes  it is very hard to remember the precise spelling
(like gray/grey or as someone else pointed out: pickaxe, pick axe or pick-axe,
or Mjolnir vs Mjollnir).
I also would like things as: "ring of teleport control" and "ring of control
teleportation" to be both accepted.

Besides: what do you know what exists? Only the stuff you have identified in
the current games or also the stuff you have had in previous games and/or
read about in some spoiler list or on this net ?
I have had a few gr[ea]y dragon scale mails but only due to wishing because
I never had the right walking cane to do the trick ;-).  If I could have only
wished for items I had discovered in the current game I guess I had to go for
a "blessed wand of nothing (20)" or so.
